@startuml
title Durable intent and interruption recovery
start
:Load run intent, child IDs, reservations and audit;
if (Unfinished operation?) then (yes)
 :Inspect existing task claims, execution records,
 worktrees and delivery operations;
 if (Verified completed child outcome?) then (yes)
  :Independently validate artifacts and adopt once;
 else (no)
  if (Confirmed safe retry with authority?) then (yes)
   :Reserve remaining attempt budget;
   :Dispatch through existing child recovery service;
  else (no)
   :Persist RECOVERY_REQUIRED;
   :Present precise human decision and evidence;
   stop
  endif
 endif
else (no)
 :Recheck current approvals and repository facts;
endif
:Persist observed transition and audit;
:Select one permitted next operation;
stop
@enduml
